.* A menu panel with a command line, as CRTMNU TYPE(*UIM) uses it.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=CMDCL BASETYPE=CMDLINE WIDTH=200.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=FLAGCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=COMMAND CLASS=CMDCL.
:VAR NAME=USER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SECOFR CLASS=FLAGCL VALUE='N'.
:VAR NAME=PGM CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='QGPL/MYPGM'.
:VAR NAME=MSGVAR CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='MSG0030'.
:COND NAME=ISSECOFR EXPR='&SECOFR. EQ "Y"'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION=KEYSHELP.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System main menu
:KEYI KEY=F23 ACTION=ACTIONS.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=MAIN HELP=HLPMAIN KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE PANELID=USER.QS/400 Main Menu
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES BOTSEP=SPACE TOPSEP=SPACE OPTIONS=OPTION HELP=HLPMENU.Select one of the following:
:MENUGRP HELP=HLPUSER.User tasks
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CALL PGM' HELP=HLP01.User tasks
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='PANEL OFFICE' HELP=HLP02.Office tasks
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='MENU GENERAL'.General system tasks
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Operator tasks
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='MSG MSGVAR' COND=ISSECOFR VARUPD=NO.Files, libraries, and folders
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='RETURN 10'.Information Assistant options
:MENUI OPTION=90 ACTION=EXIT.Sign off
:MENUI OPTION='*' ACTION=CMDLINE.Run the command typed below
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG NAME=CMD.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=OFFICE KEYL=MENUKEYS HELP=HLPMAIN.Office Tasks
:INFO DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES HELP=HLPMAIN.
:P.Office tasks are not installed on this system.
:P.Press :PK.F12:EPK. to return to the main menu.
:EINFO.
:TEXT DEPTH=2.
Fixed text at the bottom of the panel.
:ETEXT.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPMAIN.Main Menu - Help
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPMENU.Options - Help
:P.The options of this menu.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPUSER.User tasks - Help
:P.Tasks every user can run.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLP01.Option 1 - Help
:P.Calls the program &PGM. names.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLP02.Option 2 - Help
:P.Shows the office tasks panel.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
